# Rust build artefacts
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Generated output - regenerate rather than commit.
# The apps name their own files: `S` in a Graph window writes <title>-N.png,
# and --record writes whatever tape you asked for. Neither is predictable
# enough to list, so ignore the kinds. `git add -f` if one is ever worth
# keeping.
*.png
*.svg
*.tape

